    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "MISSING · 01\nConditions before topic names\nOptional policy, credentials and queue defaults must reach their parent.",
      "href": "#r12",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "MISSING · 02\nReasons at the right scope\nThe plan states export retirement; individual assertion removals still need their own reasons.",
      "href": "#r35",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "PROMISING · 03\nTwo axes, several lifetimes\nPackage home, process location, shared objects and fresh attempts carry different relationships.",
      "href": "#r06",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "PROMISING · 04\nThe path a test actually takes\nKeep stimulus, exercised implementation and assertion together.",
      "href": "#r27",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "REPEATING · 05\nA second account of the same move\nGeneric before/after prose and inventories can make the reader reconstruct the same model.",
      "href": "#r03",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "PROMISING · 06\nAn entrance with a reason to use it\nSeparate review questions and future-edit cues connect understanding to a choice.",
      "href": "#r29",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "MISSING / PROMISING · 07\nRepairs live in particular copies\nTwo edits improve two predictions; the originals and untouched conditions remain visible.",
      "href": "#r49-report",
      "visible": true
    },
